WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000 line:94%
Here’s a matter your firm assigned to Catena.

00:04.000 --> 00:11.000 line:94%
A provider returns a balance summary — no CPT codes. A returned record isn’t a ready file.

00:11.000 --> 00:19.000 line:94%
Catena rejects it, requests the itemized ledger, and verifies every line. Your paralegal never touched it.

00:19.000 --> 00:27.000 line:94%
Then a follow-up note mentions a new MRI. Catena catches it, pauses readiness, and keeps the verified records locked.

00:27.000 --> 00:35.000 line:94%
That’s a legal call — so one question goes to your attorney, with the records attached. Everything else keeps moving.

00:35.000 --> 00:42.000 line:94%
When the answer comes back, Catena prepares the demand for your review. You keep the file. Catena carries the work.
